    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a033743db406d88998e494",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我收到的一封信。仔细看过后，\n我畅想着队伍＜斗宿六＞与西沙里奥的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "832c6fdeb62c5fa6632b906b4ba36ffbc3ba5ffe83e14caa415a3d6de599ee3d",
